# Marketing copy review

Spec: `product/spec.md` (79 bytes, modified 2026-09-10 20:08 EDT)
Copy: `marketing/launch-copy.md`

## Claims unsupported by the spec

1. **"Works offline, anywhere"**
   — Spec says: *"Offline support: removed in this release."*

2. **"Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click"** (PDF and Excel)
   — Spec says: *"Export: CSV only."*

## Summary

Two claims in the launch copy are contradicted by the spec. Offline support was removed for this release, and export is CSV-only — PDF and Excel are not available. Every claim above is unsupportable as written.
